  "sourceTitle": "Liked Muse, so I cut the 30B model in half by width, distilled it back, and it does 57 of 60 tool tasks its parent does 60 of",
  "sourceBodyHash": "6774e2fe7ce5a3390652c37d1474994fc4793290968609f0594cddee26185c37",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
