  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T02:12:19.235840Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T23:42:25.251936Z",
  "totalBlocks": 21,
  "translatedBlocks": 19,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c63a1e3253c6dce7",
      "translationZh": "我一直很喜欢 Muse-Glimmer 的表现，所以想看看能不能从它衍生出一个更小的“孩子”。我还喜欢 Ornith 在何时思考、调用哪个工具方面的敏锐决策，因此让 Ornith-1.0-9B 担任策略教师，而由母模型负责生成文字。全程没有 RL，只有蒸馏。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9558cf56d29c1f9f",
      "translationZh": "向大家介绍 Xyntetik-Kvist-14B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e9aed9477fd2986",
      "translationZh": "比 Muse 母模型更小，但仍能完成大多数工具任务：在 60 项留出的闭环任务（联系人、天气、航班、货币、日期、单位、股票）中完成了 57 项。评分方式是重新执行调用，并与真实标准答案核对；母模型则完成了 60 项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "775ecf2a0855c568",
      "translationZh": "采用 Q8_0（15.4 GB）或 Q5_0 混合量化（10.3 GB）时，整个模型都能装进一张 24 GB 显卡，并通过 Xyntetik Runner 提供兼容 OpenAI、Anthropic 和 Responses 的 API，因此可以直接接入你已有的智能体循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6aafdbbd0ce73c85",
      "translationZh": "每一次失败的尝试都随模型一并公开：12 次设有门槛的运行，2 次完整通过，最终发布了 1 个。训练记录包含预注册方案、修订和缺陷，因此你可以在基于它开发之前，确切了解它会在哪些地方出问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01348753532d4aa2",
      "translationZh": "给它配一个计算器工具来做算术。没有计算器时，它会算错“2,340 的 17%”，模型卡也明确说明了这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d694e442d55b3d5",
      "translationZh": "Muse-Glimmer-30B，按宽度裁剪（隐藏维度从 6,656 降至 5,760，FFN 从 19,968 降至 10,240，注意力头数从 32 降至 24），全部 52 层均保留",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d393a8f10f1f22c",
      "translationZh": "14.44 B 参数；BF16 28.9 GB，Q8_0 15.4 GB，Q5_0 混合量化 10.3 GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dc3d3166a09a982",
      "translationZh": "6,000步，98.3 M个token，162小时，随后在智能体轨迹上训练1,440步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5401fe8d11fd86a7",
      "translationZh": "KLD为0.762，在45,056个留出位置上，满足间隔要求的top-1为84.0%（这是学生模型的一行结果，而非量化门槛）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de4340d77751d81e",
      "translationZh": "60个留出样例中有57个通过重新执行并对照真实标准验证；父模型为60，未经训练的对照模型为0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93730a161c323b97",
      "translationZh": "200个首轮回复中有199个格式正确；99次工具调用中有99次有效",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf53fc52f7c8eda9",
      "translationZh": "12次设有门控的尝试，2次全部通过，第12次尝试的版本已发布",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d601a9e9efe8d9ef",
      "translationZh": "计算任务：15项中的12项，涵盖160次运行；160次运行中有7次以陷入推理循环告终",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8b2c2b0f88b827a",
      "translationZh": "模型：https://huggingface.co/Joakimpalm-Zen/Xyntetik-Kvist-14B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5347d20611b4b595",
      "translationZh": "训练记录：https://huggingface.co/datasets/Joakimpalm-Zen/Xyntetik-Kvist-14B-training-record",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdec8e19e4ca36de",
      "translationZh": "合集：https://huggingface.co/collections/Joakimpalm-Zen/xyntetik-kvist-distilled-agents-6ab9f930af19ca84df9ebf6b",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd7aaf03a40b6e7c",
      "translationZh": "编辑补充：看了评论后，我觉得应该一开始就把这点说清楚。这不是一个能直接替代 Muse 的通用方案，也不是 gemma4 的替代品，而且以我的算力，本来就不可能做到（98M 个蒸馏 token，而真正的蒸馏需要一万亿个，我实在没有那么多算力）。目的更多是把工具调用做对。IQ4_NL 混合版本（7.6 GB）现在也已上线，在工具任务上同样取得了 57/60 的分数，但无法完整装入一张 8 GB 显卡（在 3070 上能装入 50/52 层，约 5 tok/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9c22799897162c1",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/ZenZombie117 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "distillation",
      "briefZh": "蒸馏",
      "explanationZh": "让较小模型学习教师模型的输出或行为，以迁移其能力。这里的训练仅使用蒸馏，不使用强化学习。"
    },
    {
      "term": "policy teacher",
      "briefZh": "策略教师",
